        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts announced the hearing of the case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Vincent Levy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3637675ef23b2e24cbefffc084a0828ec4d83fd773ff20e5a24ec20d9c4d46db",
